@startuml US009_SD_2
title Moving a logged item
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false

actor User
participant Frontend as UI
participant ":JWT Authentication Filter" as Auth
participant ":DailyLogController" as Ctrl
participant ":DailyLogApplicationService" as Svc
participant ":DailyLogRepository" as Repo
participant ":DailyLog" as Log
participant ":Meal" as Meal
participant "source Meal" as Source
participant "destination Meal (Dinner)" as Destination
participant ":DailyLogMapper" as Mapper

User -> UI : selects a logged item and its destination meal
UI -> Auth : PATCH /api/daily-log/today/items/{itemId}/meal\n{destinationMealType} + bearer token
Auth -> Ctrl : authenticated userId, itemId, request DTO
Ctrl -> Svc : moveItem(userId, itemId, request)
Svc -> Repo : findByUserIdAndDate(userId, today)
Repo --> Svc : today's owned DailyLog with meals and items
Svc -> Log : moveMealItem(itemId, request.destinationMealType)
Log -> Log : getItem(itemId) and locate its source meal
Log -> Log : findMealByType(destinationTypeName)
Log -> Source : removeItem(item)
Source --> Log : removed from source collection
Log -> Destination : addItem(item)
Destination --> Log : same item added alongside its four existing items
Log --> Svc : move complete
note over Log, Destination
  Item identity, FoodSnapshot, and PortionQuantity are retained.
  MealItem has no reference to Meal.
  The empty source meal remains in the log.
end note

note over Svc: Re-calculate nutrition summary
Svc -> Repo : save(log)
Repo --> Svc : saved DailyLog
Svc -> Mapper : toResponseDTO(savedLog, summary)
Mapper --> Svc : DailyLogResponseDTO with item identities and meal totals
Svc --> Ctrl : DailyLogResponseDTO
Ctrl --> UI : 200 OK + DailyLogResponseDTO
UI --> User : displays updated meals and daily nutrition

@enduml
